"Zypp Desk found no installer in {file}. It looks for install.sh, install.pl, "
"setup.sh, or a .run or .bin file."
msgstr ""
"Zypp Desk n'a trouvé aucun programme d'installation dans {file}. Il cherche "
"install.sh, install.pl, setup.sh, ou un fichier .run ou .bin."

#: zypp_desk/pages/scripts.py:718
