"Choose an installed program and say where it is published (GitHub, a fixed "
"address or a download page): Zypp Desk then looks for its new versions. "
"Nothing is downloaded or installed now."
msgstr ""
"Choisissez un programme installé et indiquez où il est publié (GitHub, une "
"adresse fixe ou une page de téléchargement) : Zypp Desk cherchera alors ses "
