#, python-brace-format
msgid "Install {pkg} anyway"
msgstr "Installer {pkg} quand même"

#: zypp_desk/simulation.py:446
msgid ""
"It comes from a repository that this upgrade leaves out, but it is taken "
"from there anyway."
msgstr ""
"Il provient d'un dépôt que cette mise à niveau laisse de côté, mais il y est "
"pris quand même."

#: zypp_desk/simulation.py:450
